@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+Added ``beacons.status`` execution module function to report, for each beacon
+configured on a minion, the epoch time it last actually fired and the error
+(if any) raised by that run. Beacons that are configured but have never
+fired report ``last_fired: None`` instead of a stale or fabricated value.
